# pub.dev package-ownership verification file. It is an empty marker that has to
# stay in the repository, where pub.dev reads it, but it has no meaning inside a
# published archive. `.pubignore` governs only the tarball, never the repository,
# so excluding it here does not affect verification. Retire the file itself in a
# release after 2.0.0, not during one.
